{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-1-20","kind":"proposition","title":"三角不等式：两边之和大于第三边","englishTitle":"In any triangle two sides taken together in any manner are greater than the remaining one.","book":1,"number":20,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.20","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.20/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":20,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-1-20@raw-08a963485264dd64","contentId":"euclid-1-20","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"08a963485264dd6477cd92687ca24164d6f24532350c888aec09bb7d8a41e758","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-1-20.statement","euclid-1-20.construction.1","euclid-1-20.construction.2","euclid-1-20.proof.1","euclid-1-20.proof.2","euclid-1-20.proof.3","euclid-1-20.proof.4","euclid-1-20.proof.5","euclid-1-20.conclusion","euclid-1-20.historical.1","euclid-1-20.historical.2","euclid-1-20.historical.3","euclid-1-20.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-1-20.statement","contentId":"euclid-1-20","revisionId":"euclid-1-20@raw-08a963485264dd64","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"696e354dc70b2a0e95b4c7afaad26325df23dc04baeb908a79aaaea661d91219","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"In any triangle two sides taken together in any manner are greater than the remaining one."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在任何三角形中,双方以任何方式结合在一起,都大于其余的三角形。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"凡三角形之两边并之必大于一边"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"每当三角形的两边相加，它们必须大于第三边。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-20.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-1-20","revisionId":"euclid-1-20@raw-08a963485264dd64","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"593803222b47a06928aab564eb33e532dff287be6591ee2c8e2fb79406415067","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let ABC be a triangle; I say that in the triangle ABC two sides taken together in any manner are greater than the remaining one, namely BA, AC greater than BC, AB, BC greater than AC, BC, CA greater than AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"ABC成为三角;我说,在三角形ABC中,双方的组合无论如何都大于其余一方,即BA、AC以上、AB以上、BC以上、AC以上、CA以上。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-20.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-1-20","revisionId":"euclid-1-20@raw-08a963485264dd64","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"194efed4373c3ca58932d326da639408ccac05e5896b26d3698825cedb0eccb5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let BA be drawn through to the point D, let DA be made equal to CA, and let DC be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BA被抽到D,DA被抽到CA,DC被抽到一起。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-20.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-1-20","revisionId":"euclid-1-20@raw-08a963485264dd64","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ce1b14705e2cb306c30e09fcaf8b459b06a4ca6d4c389bea574a0fdf91df5a90","citations":["euclid-1-5","euclid-1-cn-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since DA is equal to AC, the angle ADC is also equal to the angle ACD; [[I. 5](/principles/euclid-1-5)] therefore the angle BCD is greater than the angle ADC. [[C.N. 5](/principles/euclid-1-cn-5)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DA等于AC,ADC角度也等于ACD角度,因此BCD角度大于ADC角度。 [[I. 5](/principles/euclid-1-5)] [[C.N. 5](/principles/euclid-1-cn-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-20.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-1-20","revisionId":"euclid-1-20@raw-08a963485264dd64","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b37b88972097e07c9eaac86ac64fd8e9202bbebc93c138c7768c638c942b921b","citations":["euclid-1-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since DCB is a triangle having the angle BCD greater than the angle BDC, and the greater angle is subtended by the greater side, [[I. 19](/principles/euclid-1-19)] therefore DB is greater than BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"并且,DCB是一个三角形,其角度BCD大于角度BDC, 更大的角度被较大的数量方所分解, 因此DB大于BC。 [[I. 19](/principles/euclid-1-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-20.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-1-20","revisionId":"euclid-1-20@raw-08a963485264dd64","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"56ada78d6c37881709da55f1addca3c65b79d23c9404547ed09b1ae12ea620bf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But DA is equal to AC; therefore BA, AC are greater than BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但DA等于AC;因此,BA,AC大于BC。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-20.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-1-20","revisionId":"euclid-1-20@raw-08a963485264dd64","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0d2e36b1f71cce484d8fb431d55e85467376040e6f5ff97c93bd9a474d93654c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that AB, BC are also greater than CA, and BC, CA than AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,AB,BC也超过CA,BC大于AB。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-20.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-1-20","revisionId":"euclid-1-20@raw-08a963485264dd64","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d0def46992eb0b105b82d6bce6477450c524a884c436026a0e1ed896becf6c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-20.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-1-20","revisionId":"euclid-1-20@raw-08a963485264dd64","order":8,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a767bacf26447ac75c1864eb85eb90c16406ee2f0184be6b8ee076c3e1a38d5c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-20.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-1-20","revisionId":"euclid-1-20@raw-08a963485264dd64","order":9,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6caaca037f9834c6198b8d81bb721576cf3b72f627f27f66541dcfe21483c3cc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"凡三角形之两边并之必大于一边"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"每当三角形的两边相加，它们必须大于第三边。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-20.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-1-20","revisionId":"euclid-1-20@raw-08a963485264dd64","order":10,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7a44b6072dd4c539c6c8e2fed79adc2d507fc16acf7fe322a6f359b869e81970","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"解曰：甲乙丙角形题言甲丙甲乙边并之必大于乙丙边甲丙丙乙并之必大于甲乙甲乙乙丙并之必大于甲丙"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"解释如下：甲乙丙 三角形命题解释：甲丙甲乙 边必须大于 乙丙 边 甲丙丙乙 必须大于 甲乙甲乙乙丙 必须大于 甲丙"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-20.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-1-20","revisionId":"euclid-1-20@raw-08a963485264dd64","order":11,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"89594aa92994dac56bc32ed83dd06ebb60f33b002ad24fd9814e179efb746701","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：试于丙甲边引长之以甲乙为度截取甲丁〈本篇〉〈三〉自丁至乙作直线令甲丁甲乙两腰等而甲丁乙甲乙丁两角亦等〈本篇五〉即丙乙丁角大于甲乙丁角亦大于丙丁乙角矣夫丁丙边对丙乙丁大角也岂不大于乙丙边对丙丁乙小角者乎〈本篇十九〉又甲丁甲乙两线各加甲丙线等也则甲乙加甲丙者与丙丁等矣丙丁既大于乙丙则甲乙甲丙两边并必大于乙丙边也馀二仿此"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：尝试延长边 丙甲 并以 甲乙 作为度量 甲丁〈本篇〉〈三〉 从 丁 到 乙 画一条直线，使得 甲丁甲乙 的两条边相等，甲丁乙甲乙丁 的两个角也相等。〈本篇五〉 意味着 丙乙丁 的角大于 甲乙丁，也大于 丙丁乙。丁丙 不是比 丙乙丁 对 乙丙 的边大于 丙丁乙 的小角吗？〈本篇十九〉 和 甲丁甲乙 各自增加 甲丙 条线，因此 甲乙 加 甲丙 等于 丙丁。由于 丙丁 大于 乙丙，那么 甲乙甲丙 的两边也必须大于 乙丙，其他两个类似。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-20.source","contentId":"euclid-1-20","revisionId":"euclid-1-20@raw-08a963485264dd64","order":12,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"102e95a581c2931479c2ac19db8257c0292823ff525b05d772da5bd730b12b39","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.20/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:t